    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "Terrence leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about a raccoon with too many fingers, working at something. Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "💡 COUNTER LEARNED — a raccoon with too many fingers, working at something: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "📓 Journal: Counter: Buy it off — It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase."
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "Word reaches you, days late: Terrence stands accused over what happened to Petra. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."
    },
    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "Petra has been talking at the fires. Enough voices — tonight they call a moot. Terrence answers for what happened to Petra."
    },
    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "Petra calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."
    },
    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "Easton counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""
    },
